From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slwyts <slwyts@tuta.io>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:40:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] manager: use desktop power profiles for game mode

Recognize devices without DMI using their exact Device Tree compatible
string. Let their game-mode performance controls use the system
PowerProfiles service so desktop and game mode share one profile.

Preserve platform-profile support where configured. Hide the independent
CPU controls when the desktop service owns those settings.

